# Steampath Charger: "target player" may be its own controller (CR 115.1d): the death trigger from Bot1's own Bolt is aimed at Bot1, who goes from 20 to 19 while Bot2 stays at 20.
# (Bolting a creature of your own is legal; nothing else changes.)

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Steampath Charger
Lightning Bolt
Mountain
Mountain x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Steampath Charger.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Steampath Charger#2 = (absent)
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Steampath Charger)
Bot1.Pass
